1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一碗凉皮，是"洗"出来的
This cold noodle is washed from dough

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
先把面团，泡进清水
First soak the dough in clean water

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,000
反复揉洗，洗出面筋
Knead and rinse out the gluten

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,300
剩下的淀粉浆，上锅蒸
Steam the leftover starch slurry

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,600
揭开笼布，透明如玉
Lift the cloth — jade-clear sheets

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,900
切成宽条，滑又筋道
Cut into wide, springy ribbons

7
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,300
面筋像海绵，最吸汁
The gluten's like a sponge for sauce

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,700
油泼辣子，一勺浇上
One spoon of sizzling chili oil

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,100
酸辣爽口，三伏救星
Sour, spicy — a dog-days lifesaver

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,500
一碗从面里洗出的夏天
A summer washed out of plain dough

11
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,500
凉皮党还是米皮党？评论区见
Team wheat or team rice? Tell us
